flowchart TD
    USER[Student]

    subgraph Kali[Kali Linux workstation]
        START[FastAPI process started by start.sh]
        DB[(Configured SQL database<br/>MariaDB or MySQL by default)]

        subgraph Terminal[QTerminal or Terminator workspace]
            LEFT[Left pane<br/>guided workflow then normal shell]
            RIGHT[Right pane<br/>read-only recommendation dashboard]
        end

        API[FastAPI backend]
        TOOLS[Local bounded assessment tools<br/>Nmap, WhatWeb, curl, Nikto, Gobuster,<br/>SSLScan, enum4linux-ng and database checks]
        SEARCHSPLOIT[Local Searchsploit database]
        OLLAMA[Optional local Ollama model]
        REPORTS[Generated JSON and HTML reports]
        BROWSER[Browser print dialog for PDF]
    end

    VULNERS[Optional external Vulners correlation]
    LAB[Isolated registered Metasploitable 2 VM<br/>VirtualBox or VMware]

    USER --> LEFT
    USER -->|Reviews guidance| RIGHT
    START --> API
