    LEFT --> SEARCHSPLOIT
    RIGHT --> OLLAMA
    LEFT --> REPORTS
    REPORTS --> BROWSER
    LEFT -->|Separate confirmation-gated exercises| LAB
    LEFT -->|Session events and transcript| RIGHT

